  "title": "Look up a member's savings balance",
  "description": "Signs on to the Northpoint FCU Meridian Core Servicing Console, searches the Member Search panel by Member ID, and returns the member's name and the Current Balance of their Savings account from the Accounts table on the Member Detail screen. Read-only: it performs no transactions and changes no data.",
